WEBVTT

00:01.170 --> 00:03.230
Let me introduce you...

00:06.470 --> 00:07.730
to my girlfriend.

00:08.290 --> 00:11.540
Your... girlfriend...?

00:13.650 --> 00:16.970
<i>Oh, does he not appreciate my being here?</i>

00:17.660 --> 00:18.930
Have I met her before?

00:19.330 --> 00:23.110
Kyouya's bar. You were pretty drunk, though.

00:23.110 --> 00:24.500
Huh...

00:28.260 --> 00:29.090
Coming in?

00:29.870 --> 00:32.500
Are you okay with going in? Or are you not?

00:32.500 --> 00:34.010
Don't ask her that right in front of me.

00:34.410 --> 00:38.590
<i>I'm a little bit scared of setting foot 
in an unfamiliar world,</i>

00:40.130 --> 00:42.020
<i>but I'll be okay.</i>

02:11.230 --> 02:14.980
One Small Step

02:17.740 --> 02:19.610
<i>Wow...</i>

02:20.100 --> 02:24.120
<i>That's quite the CD collection. 
How many does he have?</i>

02:25.740 --> 02:27.120
<i>Cute!</i>

02:27.500 --> 02:29.840
How long was your trip this time?

02:29.840 --> 02:31.390
About a month.

02:31.390 --> 02:32.420
That so?

02:33.170 --> 02:37.100
Yikes, booze is all I have. 
Does your girlfriend drink?

02:37.100 --> 02:38.880
Nah, she's still nineteen.

02:39.350 --> 02:40.790
Same college?

02:40.790 --> 02:41.490
Yeah.

02:42.060 --> 02:43.950
Your Brit-rock collection has grown.

02:43.950 --> 02:45.850
You can borrow some. What interests you?

02:47.850 --> 02:50.110
What kinda music does 
your girlfriend listen to?

02:52.580 --> 02:53.360
She doesn't.

02:54.130 --> 02:56.130
Yuki can't hear.

03:02.070 --> 03:03.620
She can't hear? Wait, what?

03:04.120 --> 03:06.940
She's had a hearing disability from birth.

03:08.190 --> 03:10.250
How do you communicate?

03:11.930 --> 03:12.900
Wanna sit?

03:14.700 --> 03:19.960
Yuki reads my lips, or we type on our phones.

03:19.960 --> 03:22.290
And we're starting to use 
sign language more lately.

03:22.290 --> 03:23.380
Sign?

03:24.530 --> 03:25.640
What's wrong, Emma?

03:26.100 --> 03:27.260
Itsu-kun again?

03:27.260 --> 03:28.270
Sure is.

03:28.550 --> 03:31.740
And for some reason, 
he's studying something again.

03:31.740 --> 03:32.690
Studying what?

03:32.690 --> 03:36.430
Well... sign language or something?

03:36.770 --> 03:38.570
That explains that.

03:58.290 --> 03:58.920
So...

03:59.390 --> 04:01.050
Who did the asking out?

04:01.530 --> 04:02.250
Me.

04:02.920 --> 04:07.100
You know, I always thought 
you'd date a foreigner this time.

04:07.600 --> 04:11.810
I wasn't expecting to get into 
a relationship for a while, either.

04:12.210 --> 04:12.860
Huh?

04:13.370 --> 04:15.310
But ever since I met Yuki,

04:16.030 --> 04:17.820
I went to see her every chance I got.

04:18.130 --> 04:19.940
Even when we went out with Kyouya and Rin,

04:21.110 --> 04:23.450
I made sure we could be alone.

04:23.980 --> 04:26.770
I don't remember you ever 
being so proactive with a girl.

04:28.120 --> 04:29.200
Uh...

04:29.930 --> 04:33.240
Can you understand what I'm saying?

04:34.620 --> 04:35.830
Wow.

04:37.800 --> 04:40.330
You're in love with Itsu-kun, huh?

04:41.450 --> 04:44.990
<i>I never did tell him...</i>

04:45.380 --> 04:46.900
<i>I have to do it now?!</i>

04:57.180 --> 04:58.480
Was that sign?

04:58.830 --> 04:59.470
Yeah.

04:59.900 --> 05:02.910
I didn't know that sign, 
but I still got what she meant.

05:03.880 --> 05:05.180
Happy for you, man.

05:05.860 --> 05:09.230
<i>My feelings got through to him.</i>

05:15.970 --> 05:17.780
I'll tell Emma.

05:18.410 --> 05:21.020
She probably can't handle hearing it from you.

05:21.490 --> 05:22.420
Got it.

05:23.540 --> 05:26.410
How do I minimize the damage?

05:27.900 --> 05:32.980
I've only ever known an Emma who's 
crazy for you, ever since high school.

05:33.660 --> 05:35.890
I don't know if she can move on.

05:37.640 --> 05:39.470
What're you gonna do?

05:40.660 --> 05:43.780
Emma and I have spent too long as friends.

05:44.420 --> 05:48.130
Nothing I say or do at this point 
can change anything.

05:49.330 --> 05:53.510
I've been waiting for years and years.

05:54.620 --> 05:56.420
And that's not gonna change.

05:58.970 --> 06:01.340
<i>They're probably talking about 
something serious.</i>

06:02.310 --> 06:06.350
<i>I should try to avoid looking at their lips.</i>

06:10.210 --> 06:12.550
You're rocking some serious dark roots.

06:13.320 --> 06:15.280
Come get 'em dyed soon.

06:15.280 --> 06:16.810
Yeah, sure.

06:17.970 --> 06:20.560
Things may be more complicated for you two,

06:20.860 --> 06:22.070
but I'm rooting for you.

06:25.370 --> 06:26.650
What'd she say?

06:26.650 --> 06:28.070
"Thanks."

06:29.900 --> 06:35.140
Itsu-kun's a dear friend. Be good to him.

06:35.140 --> 06:37.020
That's my Shin.

06:37.020 --> 06:38.830
When did I become "yours"?

06:38.830 --> 06:40.810
Huh? Aren't you?

06:43.670 --> 06:45.090
<i>Phew!</i>

06:45.090 --> 06:48.010
<i>I was </i>so<i> nervous!</i>

06:48.010 --> 06:50.700
<i>Shin-san seemed like a nice guy, though.</i>

06:50.700 --> 06:53.350
Yuki. Were you nervous?

06:55.430 --> 06:57.980
Oh, is that the sign for "nervous"?

06:58.370 --> 06:59.430
That reminds me.

07:00.410 --> 07:04.360
You misread my lips 
at the crossing, didn't you?

07:05.330 --> 07:07.480
"Kiss" and "hug."

07:07.900 --> 07:08.570
<i>The kiss!</i>

07:08.570 --> 07:10.700
<i>Kiss... kiss... kiss...</i>

07:10.700 --> 07:11.990
I knew it.

07:12.500 --> 07:16.520
<i>Was that perhaps your way of 
saying hi now that you're back?!</i>

07:15.660 --> 07:21.370
Was that perhaps your way of
saying hi now that you're back?!

07:16.520 --> 07:21.370
No, I just felt like it 'cause you were 
like a cute little stoat back there.

07:19.330 --> 07:21.370
No, I just felt like it 'cause you were
like a cute little stoat back there.

07:22.190 --> 07:24.600
<i>A... A stoat?</i>

07:24.600 --> 07:29.140
If that surprised you, I'll be sure 
to give you a signal from now.

07:29.140 --> 07:30.200
<i>A signal?</i>

07:52.500 --> 07:53.530
Like this.

07:55.020 --> 07:59.580
<i>So, I'm gonna get kissed 
every time he does that?</i>

08:00.780 --> 08:03.670
You should pinch me 
if you ever want to kiss, too.

08:03.670 --> 08:06.040
<i>That's too much for me!</i>

08:06.420 --> 08:08.040
Just get used to it.

08:11.430 --> 08:15.170
We've got all the time in the world.

08:17.740 --> 08:21.390
It's rare for you to call me so early.

08:21.390 --> 08:23.140
<i>Is it? Really?</i>

08:23.140 --> 08:26.560
<b>Iryuu Shin</b>

08:24.310 --> 08:26.560
<i>I'll stop by for a drink tonight.</i>

08:26.560 --> 08:30.300
Sure. You called me just to let me know?

08:30.300 --> 08:33.820
Itsu-kun introduced me 
to his girlfriend just now.

08:33.820 --> 08:37.490
<i>Hah. Showing her off as soon as he's back, huh?</i>

08:37.780 --> 08:40.110
I'd never seen that kinda 
expression on him before.

08:40.110 --> 08:42.380
<i>I know, right?</i>

08:43.240 --> 08:44.430
Kyou-kun...

08:45.620 --> 08:48.210
Do you think it's okay for me 
to make a move on Emma now?

08:50.030 --> 08:50.890
<i>You okay there?</i>

08:51.560 --> 08:54.130
Seriously? The time's finally come?

08:54.540 --> 08:59.740
I always thought Itsu-kun liked Emma, 
somewhere deep down.

08:59.740 --> 09:02.730
<i>Nah, I seriously doubt it.</i>

09:03.450 --> 09:07.930
If anything, I feel like Emma-chan's 
been waiting for you, deep down.

09:08.340 --> 09:10.600
And I seriously doubt <i>that.</i>

09:10.900 --> 09:12.340
Really?

09:12.790 --> 09:16.360
<i>Forget that. I'll see you later.</i>

09:16.360 --> 09:18.060
Yeah, I'll be waiting.

09:25.660 --> 09:30.290
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

09:25.660 --> 09:30.290
<b>Shin
Emma, when's your
next day off?

Shin
I need to talk to you
about something</b>

09:31.090 --> 09:32.610
Shin-chan?

09:33.170 --> 09:36.210
What? You got a text from your Mr. Worldwide?

09:36.210 --> 09:38.050
N-No!

09:38.510 --> 09:40.050
It's just a friend.

09:43.700 --> 09:46.990
<i>It's my second spring in college.</i>

09:48.250 --> 09:51.450
<i>Everything seems so different from last year.</i>

09:52.190 --> 09:54.190
<b>Part-Time Staff Wanted</b>

09:52.190 --> 09:54.190
<b>No experience required.
Data entry for a travel booking website</b>

09:52.190 --> 09:54.190
<b>Weekdays-only OK! No overtime!!</b>

09:52.550 --> 09:53.420
<i>Oh!</i>

09:54.570 --> 09:57.700
<i>They put up classifieds on campus?</i>

09:57.700 --> 09:59.720
<i>I never noticed.</i>

10:01.910 --> 10:05.080
<b>Wheat</b>

10:06.420 --> 10:07.260
Hey.

10:07.260 --> 10:09.230
Don't take the last curry bread, Batayan!

10:09.760 --> 10:12.720
Come on. Wanna go halfsies, then?

10:12.720 --> 10:14.200
Yeah, no.

10:14.200 --> 10:17.220
Quit whining over a stupid 
curry bread, Ashioki.

10:17.780 --> 10:21.970
Grow up, man. Or you'll stay a virgin forever.

10:23.910 --> 10:26.770
I'd say you need to grow up too, Mitoki.

10:26.770 --> 10:28.750
Go halfsies with Batayan.

10:28.750 --> 10:32.210
Hurry up, or we're gonna be late for class.

10:33.980 --> 10:36.490
I'm here, Shin-chan!

10:36.800 --> 10:40.240
Been a while, huh? 
Since we went to karaoke, I think?

10:40.580 --> 10:43.880
You got here quick. 
Put your stuff away and take a seat.

10:43.880 --> 10:44.580
Okay!

10:47.500 --> 10:52.050
The owner really trusts you, huh?

10:52.050 --> 10:53.260
I don't know.

10:53.260 --> 10:55.750
I mean, don't you get to make 
a lot of decisions here?

10:56.090 --> 10:57.690
Not really.

10:57.690 --> 11:01.990
You always have been working hard 
toward your dream.

11:01.990 --> 11:07.340
There was even that time you did my hair up 
for me on the school's roof, remember?

11:07.340 --> 11:08.020
Emma.

11:08.500 --> 11:09.090
Hmm?

11:09.580 --> 11:11.330
Oh, nothing.

11:11.330 --> 11:13.300
Huh? What's up with that?

11:13.950 --> 11:19.650
Y'know, I was really surprised when you 
texted me that you needed to talk to me.

11:20.310 --> 11:24.670
If you need advice, I'm here for you. 
Just like you've always been there for me.

11:24.670 --> 11:27.470
Nah, it's not that. Don't worry.

11:27.470 --> 11:28.540
Yeah?

11:29.300 --> 11:31.490
Okay, shall we start with the shampoo?

11:31.490 --> 11:33.540
Yes, please.

11:34.360 --> 11:37.550
<i>You're asking me if I remember?</i>

11:38.060 --> 11:41.200
<i>Of course I do.</i>

11:44.970 --> 11:47.020
Hey, Yuna!

11:47.020 --> 11:48.750
Morning, Emma!

11:48.750 --> 11:52.320
What's with the new guy? 
He's in your class, right?

11:52.320 --> 11:54.480
Yeah, Nagi-kun! Isn't he hot?

11:54.480 --> 11:56.430
Oh, there he is.

12:01.740 --> 12:03.170
My knight in shining armor.

12:03.170 --> 12:04.740
Hubba-hubba!

12:13.460 --> 12:16.680
<i>The new guy, and... he's got kamaboko?</i>

12:20.980 --> 12:22.170
This is a nice spot.

12:24.200 --> 12:25.380
You talking to me?

12:26.060 --> 12:29.430
You're always here, right? 
Mind if I eat here, too?

12:29.870 --> 12:31.170
Feel free.

12:31.790 --> 12:33.030
What's your name?

12:34.040 --> 12:35.610
Iryuu Shin.

12:35.940 --> 12:37.030
And you?

12:38.030 --> 12:39.310
Nagi Itsuomi.

13:25.450 --> 13:27.030
He's not here today.

13:41.380 --> 13:42.990
Itsu-kun!

13:42.990 --> 13:44.760
Oh, it's Shin-kun.

13:45.290 --> 13:47.020
You know me?

13:47.020 --> 13:51.490
You're in the next class over, right? 
Say, have you seen Itsuomi-kun?

13:52.070 --> 13:53.140
Nope.

13:53.470 --> 13:56.980
He always runs off somewhere, sheesh.

14:00.340 --> 14:00.900
Hey!

14:00.900 --> 14:03.260
You're still using wired earphones?

14:03.890 --> 14:05.900
They sound better.

14:05.900 --> 14:08.540
Really? Can I listen with you?

14:16.810 --> 14:18.330
This is a nice track.

14:19.050 --> 14:19.920
Yeah.

14:26.910 --> 14:27.840
Shoot!

14:29.030 --> 14:31.010
Lunch break will be over soon!

14:31.480 --> 14:32.820
Thanks for that!

14:33.450 --> 14:36.080
You should hurry up too, Shin-kun!

14:36.080 --> 14:37.860
Right, yeah.

14:41.650 --> 14:42.690
Here, for you!

14:44.030 --> 14:44.910
What's this?

14:44.910 --> 14:47.660
Give it a listen. I highly recommend it.

14:48.230 --> 14:50.030
I didn't ask.

14:50.450 --> 14:53.410
What, you're really gonna be like that?

14:53.410 --> 14:58.270
No wonder you don't have 
any friends, Shin-kun.

14:59.580 --> 15:01.430
Like you're not all alone these days.

15:08.270 --> 15:12.330
This whole friendship business 
is so tiring, huh?

15:13.000 --> 15:14.110
Something happen?

15:14.700 --> 15:16.920
Nothing's been going my way lately.

15:17.350 --> 15:22.230
But how people feel about me 
is out of my hands,

15:22.920 --> 15:26.580
and changing myself to fit in 
doesn't sit right with me, either.

15:27.400 --> 15:31.570
So I've decided to go it alone for now.

15:32.690 --> 15:37.070
Well, enough of all that. I'll be waiting 
for your thoughts on the CD!

15:48.380 --> 15:49.890
I wasn't expecting this.

15:50.470 --> 15:53.250
I had no idea she was into this stuff.

16:28.300 --> 16:30.590
No sign of Itsu-kun today.

16:30.590 --> 16:31.300
Yeah.

16:32.180 --> 16:33.910
Say, Emma...

16:35.770 --> 16:37.890
May I touch your hair?

16:38.290 --> 16:40.330
What? Where'd that come from?

16:40.330 --> 16:41.050
Is that a no?

16:41.500 --> 16:43.350
Sure, go ahead, I guess...

16:46.530 --> 16:48.600
You have very pretty hair.

16:49.270 --> 16:50.700
More of that, please.

16:50.700 --> 16:52.530
I take real good care of it.

16:55.220 --> 16:56.280
All done.

16:56.620 --> 16:58.910
Oh, wow!

16:59.180 --> 17:03.290
I'm training to be a stylist someday, 
and this is thanks for the CD.

17:03.870 --> 17:06.510
You liked it? You can keep it!

17:06.510 --> 17:07.300
You sure?

17:08.030 --> 17:09.040
Yeah!

17:10.830 --> 17:12.940
Hmm? What's wrong?

17:14.950 --> 17:15.800
Emma...

17:16.320 --> 17:17.960
Do you like Itsu-kun?

17:18.720 --> 17:20.310
Yeah, I love him!

17:20.650 --> 17:21.870
Instant reply...

17:22.430 --> 17:26.110
I keep asking him out, 
and he keeps rejecting me.

17:26.110 --> 17:27.260
What do you like about him?

17:27.660 --> 17:28.560
Everything!

17:28.860 --> 17:33.570
<b></b>Nagi Itsuomi

17:29.390 --> 17:33.570
The moment I first laid eyes on him, I thought
my knight in shining armor had arrived.

17:34.330 --> 17:37.320
I'd never been under any illusions 
about boys before,

17:37.320 --> 17:41.830
but he shot me right through the heart.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.060
Oh?

17:43.520 --> 17:46.850
I know you're popular with 
the ladies too, Shin-chan.

17:47.620 --> 17:48.580
Shin...<i>chan</i>?

17:49.030 --> 17:51.580
You've had a bunch of girlfriends, right?

17:52.180 --> 17:53.180
Who knows.

17:54.390 --> 17:55.870
Dodging the question, are we?

17:58.620 --> 18:00.350
Why won't you go out with Emma?

18:01.790 --> 18:02.600
With Emma?

18:03.050 --> 18:07.330
She's so pretty. Where are you 
gonna find anyone like her?

18:07.330 --> 18:09.780
I'm not interested in that stuff right now.

18:12.520 --> 18:13.800
"Right now"?

18:14.620 --> 18:17.630
So you're saying you would go out 
with her, just not right now?

18:18.050 --> 18:21.740
Please go out with me, Shin-kun!

18:22.050 --> 18:25.230
I've liked you for a long time.

18:25.230 --> 18:27.760
I want to be with you more....

18:27.760 --> 18:28.420
Sure.

18:28.820 --> 18:29.880
Really?!

18:29.880 --> 18:30.630
Yeah.

18:30.630 --> 18:33.300
Wow... Someone pinch me!

18:33.300 --> 18:34.630
I'm so happy!

18:35.550 --> 18:39.720
<i>Once Itsu-kun's "right now" passes, 
I'm sure the two of them will get together.</i>

18:42.050 --> 18:46.410
<i>It doesn't matter how much 
I love Emma. I'm no match for him.</i>

18:47.800 --> 18:51.580
<i>I wish they'd just hurry up and get together.</i>

18:52.230 --> 18:54.410
<i>At least then I'll be able 
to cast these feelings aside.</i>

18:55.660 --> 18:59.390
Shin-chan, how's it going with your girlfriend?

19:01.990 --> 19:05.180
Didn't I say I'd make us lunch today?

19:05.180 --> 19:08.050
You're always with those two!

19:08.550 --> 19:11.250
Am I not your girlfriend? 
Was that something I just dreamed up?!

19:11.560 --> 19:13.820
You are, sorry.

19:13.820 --> 19:17.010
Forget it. I know you're in love 
with Emma-san, anyway.

19:17.010 --> 19:17.950
Wha?!

19:17.950 --> 19:21.980
It's clear as day. 
You're always looking her way.

19:22.500 --> 19:25.460
You pay zero attention to me, 
even when we're talking.

19:25.460 --> 19:27.430
Did you really think I wouldn't notice?

19:28.120 --> 19:30.210
Why don't you just ask her out now?

19:30.210 --> 19:33.240
Quit using other girls 
as a replacement for her,

19:33.720 --> 19:36.480
and make it clear right now 
who's number one in your heart!

19:50.340 --> 19:51.470
Emma's the one...

19:53.770 --> 19:57.160
Emma's the one person 
I will never fall for, even if it kills me.

19:58.500 --> 20:00.720
Wow, why'd you attack <i>me</i> like that?!

20:01.260 --> 20:04.200
You're a <i>jerk</i>, Shin-chan!

20:09.260 --> 20:12.290
Whoa, my hair's all silky now!

20:12.290 --> 20:13.730
You're so good, Shin-chan!

20:14.360 --> 20:18.170
You're a master at making me pretty.

20:19.130 --> 20:21.300
Emma, listen...

20:21.300 --> 20:23.990
I hope Itsu-kun notices.

20:27.210 --> 20:29.680
You really love Itsu-kun, huh?

20:29.680 --> 20:31.440
Yeah, I love him loads!

20:31.440 --> 20:32.810
Zero hesitation...

20:32.810 --> 20:34.750
I mean, I love him! Why deny it?

20:40.930 --> 20:41.820
You're right.

20:46.050 --> 20:48.550
<b>RY Misc. 3</b>

20:55.510 --> 20:58.580
How were your new note-takers, Yuki?

20:59.190 --> 21:00.820
They were really nice!
A huge relief.

21:01.080 --> 21:05.210
Sorry I had to quit. There's just 
way more to do as a third-year.

21:05.800 --> 21:08.570
I promise I'll help when I can, though.

21:09.740 --> 21:10.580
Hey.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.940
Oh, Itsuomi-san.

21:15.550 --> 21:19.130
<i>It's a strange feeling, meeting him at college.</i>

21:22.370 --> 21:25.120
Feels like it's been a while since we hung out.

21:25.120 --> 21:29.220
It'd be great if Kyouya-san could join us 
and we could all go somewhere, huh?

21:32.670 --> 21:35.550
She says the four of us 
should go somewhere again.

21:36.230 --> 21:40.840
Wow, Itsuomi-san. Maybe I should 
pick up sign language, too.

21:40.840 --> 21:42.230
Yeah, do it.

21:42.230 --> 21:45.560
It seems difficult. I don't know if I can.

21:48.340 --> 21:49.900
She says you'll be fine.

21:49.900 --> 21:51.190
Really?

21:51.860 --> 21:53.390
But that sounds good, actually.

21:54.580 --> 21:57.640
Let's invite Kyouya and go 
on a day trip somewhere.

21:58.130 --> 21:59.630
Sign language boot camp.

21:59.750 --> 22:03.250
Or do you not?

21:59.880 --> 22:03.250
Wanna do a sign
language boot camp?

22:00.520 --> 22:01.400
What do you say?

22:01.400 --> 22:03.250
<i>Wow, a boot camp?</i>

